<div class="row mb-4">
    <div class="col-12">
        <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
            <ol class="breadcrumb">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/insurance">Insurance</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item active">Broker Management</li>
            </ol>
        </nav>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Intermediary & Broker Management</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Total lifecycle control of your distribution ecosystem, ensuring regulatory alignment and 
            commercial transparency for every broker, agent, and bancassurance partner.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Distribution Channel Integrity</h2>
        <p>
            Build a definitive digital registry of your entire distribution network. The Broker 
            Management module maintains comprehensive profiles for every intermediary, 
            centrally tracking IPEC registration certificates, professional indemnity 
            coverage, and appointment documents. Automated alerts notify management 
            of document expiration, ensuring that your organization only does business with 
            fully licensed and compliant partners.
        </p>
        <p>
            Specific "Binding Authority" limits can be configured per broker, defining exactly 
            which product classes and sum-insured levels each partner is authorized to 
            quote or bind directly, maintaining tight control over organizational 
            risk exposure.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Production & Quality Analytics</h2>
        <p>
            Go beyond simple production totals. The system provides deep analytical insight into 
            the quality of business being introduced by each intermediary. Analyze 
            renewal retention rates and loss ratios on a per-broker basis, identifying 
            those distribution partners who consistently bring high-quality, 
            profitable risks into the portfolio.
        </p>
        <p>
            Monthly performance statements are generated automatically, visualizing 
            Gross Written Premiums (GWP) achieved versus targets, along with 
            corresponding commission levels, providing brokers with a clear view of 
            their commercial standing with the insurer.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Unified Intermediary Ledger</h2>
        <p>
            Manage the complex financial relationship with brokers through a dedicated sub-ledger. 
            Track all transactions associated with an intermediary—commissions due, 
            payments made, and premium set-offs—in a single, reconciled interface. 
            Direct integration with the central financial core ensures that broker 
            accounts are always in balance with the General Ledger, providing the 
            absolute accuracy required for annual audits and IPEC reporting.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-12 text-center">
        <p class="small mb-0">
            <a href="/insurance" class="text-decoration-none">← Back to Insurance</a>
        </p>
